+## Access and audit
+
+- `apiKeys` holds `{ key, name, role }`; `role` is `viewer`, `cook` or
+  `manager`. A key with any other role is treated as unknown. Files without
+  `apiKeys` open, but no request is accepted until keys are added.
+- `audit` holds one entry per data-changing request: `{ id, at, keyName,
+  method, path, status }` (ids from `seq.audit`). Entries are never edited
+  or deleted.
